{title: Prem Tumi}
{artist: Tahsan Khan}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Aamar kolpona [Em]jure,        [C]Je [Am]golpera [D]chilo
[C]Arale [D]shob [Em]lukono,        [G]Sei golpera [Em]shob
[C]Rongeen [Am]holo [D]poloke,        [C]Tomake [D]hotath peye [G]jeno
[Em]Prem tumi [G]ashbe [C]ebhabe,        [Am]Abar [C]hariye jabe [D]bhabini
[Em]Aajo ache se [G]poth sudhu [C]nei tumi,        Bolo [Am]kothay [C]acho [D]ovimani
